    "rationale": "Synthesis of 16 empirical studies demonstrates that while adaptive AI tutoring accelerates in-task procedural calculation (+0.66g) and enhances conceptual modeling (+0.46g) under Socratic scaffolding, unguided access causes severe delayed retention loss (-0.27g) and risks widening urban-rural inequities without teacher mediation. An unconstrained rollout is strongly contraindicated, while an outright ban deprives resource-strained students of vital personalized assistance. Therefore, a restricted PILOT verdict is adjudicated: implementing a strict 4-phase fading scaffolding protocol with mandatory closed-book solo assessment and hard stop thresholds.",
